# Paths that do not affect formatting, Clippy, the build, or tests.
# `*` does not match `/`. A path that is not listed runs the Rust checks.
# Workflows, actions, and scripts are not listed: changing them should still
# exercise the Rust jobs. tests/fixtures are not listed either.
**/*.md
.github/ci-skip-paths
.github/dependabot.yml
.gitignore
release-plz.toml
